{"content":[{"c":["LONGSUFFERING*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Word denoting long and patient endurance. This is a word used in the ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," four times in the OT (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.34.6","r":"Exod.34.6","rawR":"Exod.34.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.34.6","value":"Exod.34.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 34:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.14.18","r":"Num.14.18","rawR":"Num.14.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.14.18","value":"Num.14.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 14:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.86.15","r":"Ps.86.15","rawR":"Ps.86.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.86.15","value":"Ps.86.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 86:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.15.15","r":"Jer.15.15","rawR":"Jer.15.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.15.15","value":"Jer.15.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 15:15"},") and 13 times in the NT. The ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," and other modern versions use “forbearance” and “patience” and other synonyms."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Longsuffering is usually applied to God (",{"href":"?bref=Rom.2.4","r":"Rom.2.4","rawR":"Rom.2.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rom.2.4","value":"Rom.2.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rom 2:4"},"). A holy God must punish sin. Yet his loving nature delays that punishment to give the sinner time to repent and turn away from his sin (",{"href":"?bref=1Tim.1.16","r":"1Tim.1.16","rawR":"1Tim.1.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Tim.1.16","value":"1Tim.1.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Tm 1:16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Pet.3.20","r":"1Pet.3.20","rawR":"1Pet.3.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Pet.3.20","value":"1Pet.3.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Pt 3:20"},"). Longsuffering is also a Christian virtue, a fruit of the Spirit (",{"href":"?bref=Gal.5.22","r":"Gal.5.22","rawR":"Gal.5.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gal.5.22","value":"Gal.5.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gal 5:22"},"). Christians need to exercise this in their relationships with each other."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Longsuffering","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 34:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.34.6","rawQueryValue":"Exod.34.6","sourceRefExact":"Exod.34.6"},{"anchorText":"Nm 14:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.14.18","rawQueryValue":"Num.14.18","sourceRefExact":"Num.14.18"},{"anchorText":"Ps 86:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.86.15","rawQueryValue":"Ps.86.15","sourceRefExact":"Ps.86.15"},{"anchorText":"Jer 15:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.15.15","rawQueryValue":"Jer.15.15","sourceRefExact":"Jer.15.15"},{"anchorText":"Rom 2:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rom.2.4","rawQueryValue":"Rom.2.4","sourceRefExact":"Rom.2.4"},{"anchorText":"1 Tm 1:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Tim.1.16","rawQueryValue":"1Tim.1.16","sourceRefExact":"1Tim.1.16"},{"anchorText":"1 Pt 3:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Pet.3.20","rawQueryValue":"1Pet.3.20","sourceRefExact":"1Pet.3.20"},{"anchorText":"Gal 5:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gal.5.22","rawQueryValue":"Gal.5.22","sourceRefExact":"Gal.5.22"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ec7c148d31fd6dcbf29fe8e0306d151bc236a4987deb3cef97bcdb5b8e479d52","sourceItemName":"Longsuffering","sourceItemOrder":122,"sourceMember":"Articles/L.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Longsuffering","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Longsuffering*","title":"Longsuffering*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}